ABOUT THE NUMBERS

This software keeps financial records. It is distributed WITHOUT WARRANTY, and
that is not a formality: whoever runs it is responsible for their own books,
their own backups and their own compliance with the law where they operate.

The system never assumes an interest rate is legal. It records what you tell it
and shows it transparently. It does not consult any external source and it will
never alter a contract or a balance on its own.

Before trusting it with a real business, read the financial rules in README.md
and run `npm run verify`.
